Third-party sources
-------------------

easyrazer
  https://github.com/janeblower/easyrazer
  License: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Used: layout.json and keymap.json (key geometry, key IDs and the LED map) are derived from its data.
  Protocol facts for analog actuation, Rapid Trigger, Snap Tap and the per-key colour frame.

OpenRazer
  https://github.com/openrazer/openrazer
  License: GPL-2.0-or-later (driver)
  Used: protocol facts only (the 90-byte report format, checksum and lighting commands).
  No OpenRazer code is included.

SensorFinder for Razer Huntsman
  https://github.com/ohy1/SensorFinder-for-Razer-Huntsman
  License: MIT
  Used: protocol facts only (the actuation and release-point rules and the travel report format).
  No SensorFinder code is included.

Python packages installed by install.sh (not included in this repository): pyusb (BSD-3-Clause),
pywebview (BSD-3-Clause) and their dependencies, listed in requirements.txt. libusb (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
is installed through Homebrew.
